# CA cert is a generated, rotatable secret (see proxy/README.md,
# `handibot proxy-ca-cert <profile>`) - not source, don't commit it.
# policy.json IS tracked: its content is fully determined by the static
# profile->port map in handibot's config.py defaults, so it's checked in
# like the old chrome-policy.json/firefox-policies.json were. Regenerate it
# by hand if HANDIBOT_PROXY_CA_PORT_MAP is ever overridden from the default.
*/ca-cert.pem
